.TH UNIPASTE 1 unipaste\-VERSION
.SH NAME
unipaste \- suckless universal rich text converter and stream formatter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B unipaste
.RB [ \-urv ]
.RB [ \-m
.IR mode ]
.RB [ \-t
.IR table ]
.RB [ \-l
.IR link ]
.RI [ file\ ... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B unipaste
is a lightweight, zero-dependency POSIX stream utility that converts rich text,
HTML, and clipboard payloads into beautifully formatted plain text, Markdown,
or terminal output.
.P
It is engineered to solve clipboard fidelity loss across applications (e.g. copying
from Slack, Teams, or web browsers and pasting into Notepad, terminals, or code editors).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-m " mode"
Sets the output formatting mode:
.RS
.TP
.B plain
Formatted ASCII plain text tailored for Notepad and standard text editors (default).
.TP
.B markdown
Clean GitHub-Flavored Markdown (GFM).
.TP
.B terminal
Formatted output using ANSI escape sequences (bold headings, underlined links).
.RE
.TP
.BI \-t " table"
Sets the table formatting style:
.RS
.TP
.B grid
ASCII box borders (+---+---+).
.TP
.B markdown
Markdown pipe table (| a | b |).
.TP
.B tsv
Tab-separated values.
.TP
.B simple
Space-aligned columns.
.RE
.TP
.BI \-l " link"
Sets the hyperlink formatting style:
.RS
.TP
.B bracket
Render as "text (url)" (default for plain mode).
.TP
.B inline
Render as "[text](url)" (default for markdown mode).
.TP
.B text
Suppress URLs and keep text only.
.TP
.B footnote
Place reference numbers "[1]" and emit footnotes at the end.
.RE
.TP
.B \-u
Use UTF-8 Unicode box-drawing characters for tables.
.TP
.B \-r
Emit Windows CRLF (\\r\\n) line endings.
.TP
.B \-v
Print version information and exit.
.TP
.B \-h
Print help message and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
Convert HTML from clipboard (via xclip) to clean plain text:
.PP
.nf
.RS
xclip -selection clipboard -t text/html -o | unipaste
.RE
.fi
.PP
Convert a rich HTML file to clean GitHub-Flavored Markdown:
.PP
.nf
.RS
unipaste -m markdown document.html > document.md
.RE
.fi
.PP
Convert HTML with Unicode tables and footnotes:
.PP
.nf
.RS
unipaste -u -l footnote report.html
.RE
.fi
